<title>KENYA: SOCCER-KENYA BEAT BURKINA FASO 4-3 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KENYA BEAT BURKINA FASO 4-3 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya beat Burkina Faso 4-3</p>
<p>(halftime 0-2) in their World Cup soccer Africa Group One</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Kenya- Mike Okoth 52, 59, 82, Francis Were 67</p>
<p>Burkina Faso - Mamadou Zongo 15, 65, Firmin Sanou 40 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
